# Operator-supplied optional model provider settings. Copy to a private file
# outside version control, then set COMPANION_ENV_FILE to that absolute path.
# Detector/BGE code, dependencies and weights are already inside the shared
# companion image. Prepare it once in the host shell, before starting a run:
# MODEL_ROOT=/absolute/path/to/model-runtime sh containers/companion/build.sh
# MODEL_ROOT is a build input, not a runtime mount or provider setting.
# COMPANION_IMAGE may select that same built image for all four UAVs.
# Never put API keys into scenario YAML, the image, or evidence archives.
# Use the operator's existing OpenCode/DeepSeek-compatible endpoint/profile.
# No live provider configuration has been verified by this deployment.
AAS_LLM_BASE_URL=
AAS_LLM_MODEL=
# AAS_LLM_API_KEY is supplied by the operator in their private file if needed.
